  m_Text: 'In the world of sticky speeds, crazy jelly races begin, where not only
    the fastest but also the smartest wins!



    Players control their bouncy and
    stretchy jellies, overcoming dangerous tracks full of traps: deep holes, sharp
    saws and barriers. But along the way there are cannons that charge the jelly
    with energy, allowing it to rush forward at incredible speed!'
